How to generate Bash completion script 

Compile the program using cargo build

Run the program using the generate flag and the path to the file you want to create:

./target/debug/ph-cli --generate ph-cli.bash

Run 'source ./ph-cli.bash' (this will only work for your session, if you want it to be permanent, you can add it to /etc/bash_completion.d or put source ./ph-cli.bash in your .bashrc or .bash_profile

Now run the program 

target/debug/ph-cli

And you can tab complete command line arguments 
